# The rproxy image the controller deploys (managed mode, the chart's fleet
# DaemonSet): rproxy-api's static musl binary, built from rproxy-api (a release
# tarball, or a checkout in CI) into dist/<TARGETARCH>/rproxy-api.
FROM alpine:3.24
ARG TARGETARCH
RUN apk add --no-cache ca-certificates
COPY dist/${TARGETARCH}/rproxy-api /usr/local/bin/rproxy-api
USER 65532:65532
ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/rproxy-api"]
